All cmevla are cmene, but not all cmene are cmevla. The same as with square=
s and rectangles.
(cmevla are to cmene as squares are to rectangles)
cmevla are the specific type of cmene that end in a consonant and glottal s=
top.
la.djan. and la gleki are both cmene, but only la.djan. is a cmevla.
